	\L_03424:
	\L_0336e:
	!VAR0516 : 1!
	\L_03360:
	\L_0330c:
	ZH 1:
	'Well, don’t say that, Chizuko.'
	R
	'Although... She does seem to'
	R
	'be trouble. Maybe I should put'
	R
	'her in my harem...? Hmmmmmmmm.'
	\L_03431:
	\L_03424:
	\L_0337c:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m sorry...'
	R
	'Aah, I can’t believe she'
	R
	'appeared in Leazas Castle...'
	\L_03431:
	ZH 1:
	'If this was going to happen,'
	R
	'we should’ve used her to make'
	R
	'the Flash...'
	\L_03431:
	\L_03424:
	\L_0330c:
	ZH 1:
	'Hey now, that’s a dangerous'
	R
	'thing to say...'
	\L_03431:
	\L_03424:
	\L_0336e:
	!VAR0516 : 52!
	\L_03360:
	\L_0330c:
	ZH 1:
