	\L_03424:
	\L_0330c:
	ZH 1:
	'Mew...'
	\L_03431:
	\L_03424:
	\L_0336e:
	!VAR0516 : 1!
	\L_03360:
	\L_0330c:
	ZH 1:
	'Whoa...'
	R
	'Is, uh, Annis alive...?'
	\L_03431:
	\L_03424:
	\L_0337c:
	ZH 1:
	'Don’t worry...'
	R
	'She’s stupid, so she’s sturdy.'
	\L_03431:
	ZH 1:
	'Anyway, King Rance, I’ll get'
	R
	'her to understand the current'
	R
	'war situation, but... Please'
